@startuml RecipeManagementUseCase
title Recipe Management System -- Use Case Diagram
left to right direction

actor "Cook (User)" as Cook

rectangle "Recipe Management System" {
    usecase "Create a recipe"           as UC1
    usecase "View all recipes"          as UC2
    usecase "View ordered recipes"      as UC3
    usecase "Change sort strategy"      as UC4
    usecase "Transition recipe status"  as UC5
    usecase "Filter recipes by status"  as UC6
    usecase "View recipe details"       as UC7
    usecase "Show summary"              as UC8
    usecase "Remove a recipe"           as UC9
    usecase "Load demo scenario"        as UC10
}

Cook --> UC1
Cook --> UC2
Cook --> UC3
Cook --> UC4
Cook --> UC5
Cook --> UC6
Cook --> UC7
Cook --> UC8
Cook --> UC9
Cook --> UC10

note bottom of UC1 : Uses Factory Method\nto build the right\nconcrete recipe.
note bottom of UC3 : Uses Strategy --\ndelegates ordering to\nthe current strategy.
note bottom of UC4 : Strategy swap --\ntakes effect on the\nnext ordered query.
note bottom of UC5 : Validated by\nRecipeStatus state machine.

@enduml
